    rdfs:label "Draft: ZFIN holds zero phenotype rows for kcnh2a because the longfin phenotypes are filed against the chromosomal feature rather than against the gene, so a gene-keyed pipeline silently misses the best-known fin-overgrowth mutant; and the clone-autonomy experiment behind its sufficiency grade used human KCNH2, not the zebrafish gene" ;
